<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:lrc="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" lrc:timing="Word" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><sourceMetadata xmlns="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.160"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">Oh, oh-oh-oh, oh-oh-oh-oh</text><text for="L2">I wake up, together with the black night (hey)</text><text for="L3">Step right up, who's next in line? (Hey)</text><text for="L4">Nothing in sight, a wild guerrilla show</text><text for="L5">Bow down and scream 'till your voice breaks, oh yeah</text><text for="L6">This vibe is lame, make a transition</text><text for="L7">Unleash the madness, let it show</text><text for="L8">Men with their pride, women with their masks</text><text for="L9">Confidence with no reason, how interesting (interesting)</text><text for="L10">I show it off, all very openly</text><text for="L11">I creep into you like an allergy</text><text for="L12">Chaotic energy heating the world crazy</text><text for="L13">Tonight, we're living in anarchy</text><text for="L14">I set it on fire (woo)</text><text for="L15">Burn your heart down (woo)</text><text for="L16">I wanna make you go crazy</text><text for="L17">B-I-G, yeah, we bang like this, everyone together</text><text for="L18">Like you've been shot</text><text for="L19">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L20">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L21">Bbang-ya bbang-ya bbang-ya</text><text for="L22">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L23">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L24">Bbang-ya bbang-ya bbang-ya</text><text for="L25">All stop right there, all stop right there</text><text for="L26">All stop right there, all stop right there</text><text for="L27">Tonight, we'll see the end, see the end</text><text for="L28">Tonight, we'll see the end</text><text for="L29">Bbang-ya bbang-ya bbang-ya</text><text for="L30">I take you there, right at this moment (hey)</text><text for="L31">When the crimson sky dances along (hey)</text><text for="L32">Circling around, you and I are in Valhalla</text><text for="L33">Praise it louder, let it spread more</text><text for="L34">We go hard, all-nighter, run all night, skipping the earth</text><text for="L35">This track's the apex, call the gods, let 'em flex</text><text for="L36">The loud scream is a haunting melody, dark spirit's connecting link</text><text for="L37">Four directions, five ways, going unhinged, wow</text><text for="L38">I set it on fire (woo)</text><text for="L39">Burn your heart down (woo)</text><text for="L40">I wanna make you go crazy</text><text for="L41">B-I-G, yeah, we bang like this, everyone together</text><text for="L42">Like you've been shot</text><text for="L43">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L44">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L45">Bbang-ya bbang-ya bbang-ya</text><text for="L46">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L47">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L48">Bbang-ya bbang-ya bbang-ya</text><text for="L49">All stop right there, all stop right there</text><text for="L50">All stop right there, all stop right there</text><text for="L51">Tonight, we'll see the end, see the end</text><text for="L52">Tonight, we'll see the end</text><text for="L53">Bbang-ya bbang-ya bbang-ya</text><text for="L54">Ready or not</text><text for="L55">Yeah, we don't give a what</text><text for="L56">Ready or not</text><text for="L57">Yeah, we don't give a what</text><text for="L58">Let's go</text><text for="L59">Guys all go above</text><text for="L60">Girls all get low</text><text for="L61">Cock it, bang bang bang</text><text for="L62">Let the bass drum go</text><text for="L63">Guys all go above</text><text for="L64">Girls all get low</text><text for="L65">Cock it, bang bang bang</text><text for="L66">Let the bass drum go</text><text for="L67">Eh-eh, eh-eh, eh-eh-eh</text><text for="L68">Let the bass drum go</text><text for="L69">Eh-eh, eh-eh, eh-eh-eh</text><text for="L70">Let the bass drum go</text><text for="L71">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L72">Eh-eh, eh-eh, eh-eh-eh</text><text for="L73">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L74">Let the bass drum go</text><text for="L75">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L76">Eh-eh, eh-eh, eh-eh-eh</text><text for="L77">Bang bang bang</text><text for="L78">Let the bass drum go</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>TEDDY</songwriter><songwriter>G-DRAGON</songwriter><songwriter>T.O.P</songwriter><songwriter>VERBAL</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ko-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="7.482" end="8.769" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">Oh,</span> <span begin="8.769" end="9.087" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">oh-</span><span begin="9.087" end="10.026" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">oh-</span><span begin="10.026" end="10.469" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">oh,</span> <span begin="10.469" end="10.860" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">oh-</span><span begin="10.860" end="11.746" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">oh-</span><span begin="11.746" end="12.653" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">oh-</span><span begin="12.653" end="14.084" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">oh</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="13.826" end="13.954" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nan</span>  <span begin="13.954" end="14.398" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kkae eo</span> <span begin="14.398" end="14.731" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">na</span>  <span begin="14.839" end="15.297" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kka man</span>  <span begin="15.297" end="15.775" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">bam gwa</span>  <span begin="15.775" end="16.004" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ham</span> <span begin="16.004" end="16.434" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kke</span>  <span begin="16.560" end="16.951" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Hey)</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="17.414" end="17.514" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">da</span>  <span begin="17